e\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"With a default of 100 and a batch allowance of 1000, the batch allowance is 10 times the default, not 50 times.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-043\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A batch credential’s allowance is measured over exactly the same window as the default, not under a separate counting scheme.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text explicitly says the batch allowance is not under a separate counting scheme.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-044\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The window, the header and the body are identical to the interactive case\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the window, header and body are identical to the interactive case.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-045\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"so a client written for one tier needs no change at all to run against the other\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states a client for one tier needs no change to run against the other.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-046\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Nothing else about the two tiers differs.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states nothing else about the two tiers differs.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-047\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Log every refusal seen\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text instructs logging every refusal seen.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-048\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"keep the log for at least a week\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text instructs keeping the log for at least a week.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-049\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A caller that cannot say how often it was refused last week cannot argue for a larger cap\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states such a caller cannot argue for a larger cap.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-050\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"nobody at the far end will assemble that argument on its behalf\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Nobody at the far end, which includes the platform team, will assemble the argument on the caller's behalf.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-051\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The gateway refuses a request for three reasons\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the gateway refuses a request for three reasons.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-052\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"only one of them is the cap described above\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states only one of the three reasons is the cap.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-053\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the other two have nothing to do with how much traffic a caller has sent in the window it is currently in\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the other two reasons are unrelated to traffic sent in the current window.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-054\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A credential may be suspended\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states a credential may be suspended.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-055\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a route may be closed for maintenance\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states a route may be closed for maintenance, which matches closure while being repaired.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-056\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the body limit is 5 megabyte.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-057\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit, in which case it is refused before it has been read at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states an oversized body is refused before it has been read at all.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-058\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the loop spends its whole budget without reaching the service.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-059\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the log afterwards shows nothing but a long run of refusals and no successes\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the log shows a long run of refusals and no successes.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-060\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"which reads like an outage and is not one\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the situation reads like an outage but is not one.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-061\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the wasted budget is the caller’s own\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the wasted budget is the caller's own.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-062\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Getting what it needs without any change to the cap means it does not need a larger cap.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-063\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"That is the cheapest fix available to anybody\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text calls moving work to a quieter hour the cheapest fix available.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-064\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"it is available to almost everybody\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the fix is available to almost everybody.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-065\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A cap can be raised\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states a cap can be raised.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-066\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"but not on the strength of an assertion that the current one is too small\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states caps are not raised on the strength of such an assertion.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-067\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Bring the refusal counts for a full week\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text instructs bringing refusal counts for a full week.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-068\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the shape of the traffic across the day\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text lists the shape of traffic across the day as something to bring.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-069\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the deadline that traffic is serving\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text lists the deadline the traffic serves as something to bring.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-070\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty before it looks at the number at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the team examines smoothness or burstiness before the number.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-071\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a burst is cheaper to smooth out than it is to serve at its peak\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states a burst is cheaper to smooth out than to serve at its peak.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-072\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states requests reach the platform team through the usual channel.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-073\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"There is no expedited path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states there is no expedited path.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-074\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"are answered within two working days\",\"evi